{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "title": "Independent broad-IPA adjudication queue for the NIKL surface regression set",
  "purpose": "Prepare a review queue without fabricating IPA gold. Korean surface strings and NIKL citations are source evidence for Korean surface forms only; they do not independently determine broad IPA or Ukrainian target choices.",
  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    "At least one qualified Korean phonetics reviewer independently transcribes each case into broad IPA from the source-backed Korean surface, without seeing another reviewer's IPA first.",
    "Record syllable boundaries and preserve relevant vowel length, aspiration, fortisness, affrication, and other contrasts required by the project's broad-IPA convention.",
    "A second qualified reviewer independently reviews the form; disagreements remain unresolved until documented and reconciled.",
    "Record the exact reference or methodological convention used for each adjudication; do not treat NIKL Hangul pronunciation notation as IPA.",
    "Only after independent review may candidateBroadIpa be populated and status changed to ADJUDICATED; target-layer validation remains a separate task."
  ],
